  "texts": [
    { "content": "你从地下走出来，迎面撞上了一个人。", "delay": 0 },
    { "content": "{{NPC_SLOT_7:greeting}}", "delay": 1500 },
    { "content": "是{{NPC_SLOT_7:name}}。{{NPC_SLOT_7:identity}}。", "delay": 1000 },
    { "content": "\"你看到了。\"{{NPC_SLOT_7:name}}的声音很平静，但你听出了底下的波澜。", "delay": 2000 },
    { "content": "\"三百年了。\"他说，\"每一个知道真相的人，都要做出选择。\"", "delay": 2000 },
    { "content": "\"留下来，保守秘密。\"", "delay": 1500 },
    { "content": "\"离开，永远闭嘴。\"", "delay": 1500 },
    { "content": "\"或者——\"", "delay": 1000 },
    { "content": "{{NPC_SLOT_7:reveal}}", "delay": 2000 },
    { "content": "{{ITEM_SLOT_D:greeting}}", "delay": 1500 },
    { "content": "天边泛起了鱼肚白。你必须做出决定了。", "delay": 2000 }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "text": "\"我不会沉默。\"",
